{com}. 
. drop Neighbor*Cheaper
{txt}
{com}. rename state_main state_abbrev 
{res}{txt}
{com}. 
. ** identifying state-pairs with (1) frequently cheaper prices, (2) cheaper average prices, and (3) cheaper median prices
. local num_sds = 0.5
{txt}
{com}. 
. * this comes out to 215+ months with a cheaper neighbor --> frequently_cheaper
. bysort state_abbrev neighbor_state: egen temp_frequently_cheaper = mean(pct_cheaper)
{txt}
{com}. sum temp_frequently_cheaper 

{txt}    Variable {c |}        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
{hline 13}{c +}{hline 57}
temp_frequ~r {c |}{res}        224    .4963666     .243017   .0138889   .9833333
{txt}
{com}. gen frequently_cheaper = temp_frequently_cheaper < (r(mean) + `num_sds'*r(sd))
{txt}
{com}. 
. bysort state_abbrev neighbor_state: egen temp_avg_cheaper = mean(avg_pdiff)
{txt}
{com}. sum temp_avg_cheaper 

